<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "A channel can carry a small coloured plaque beside its name that says what it is about — news, games, sport — so a list of rooms can be read at a glance. It sits ahead of the channel's language flag in its tab, the conversations list, the channel list and above the conversation."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_general}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Setting It")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "The founder of a registered channel chooses it with /cs category followed by one of the names below, or under Channel Central ▸ Registration ▸ Category. /cs category none takes it away, and /cs category alone shows the current one."
  )}
</p>
<pre>{dgettext("help_channels", "/cs category news")}</pre>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_channel}>{dgettext("help_channels", "The Categories")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li :for={category <- Categories.codes()}>
    <.channel_category category={category} class="mr-1" /><code>{category}</code>
    — {Categories.label(category)}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Rules & Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "A channel nobody gave a category shows no plaque."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Only the founder can set it, and only on a registered channel. Dropping the registration takes it away."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_channels", "The Retro Games channels are about games.")}</li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_channels", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-cs">{dgettext("help_channels", "/cs")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="chanserv-ui">
    {dgettext("help_channels", "ChanServ in Channel Central")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-language-flags">
    {dgettext("help_channels", "Language Flags")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
